  "gradeRuleDescribe": {
    "yms_year": 114.0,
    "yms_smester": 2.0,
    "cls_id": "CB02113",
    "sub_id": "51901",
    "scr_dup": "001",
    "tpa_score_new": "<div>評量方式 動作 這門課的最後分數是共由下面幾個項目來綜合評分 1. 期中考占百分之三十 2. 期末考占百分之三十 3. 小考和回家功課共占百分之十五 (回家功課必須在老師規定截止日繳交) 4. 課堂參與和上課點名共占百分之二十五</div>\n",
    "tpa_score_new_en": "Assessment Methods\tAction\nThe grade of this class is evaluated by the followings\\ points: \na. Midterm exam accounts for thirty percent\nb. Final  exam accounts for  thirty percent \nc. Quiz and homework  account for fifteen percent (Homework needed to be sumitted by the deadline required by the class instructor)\nd. Attendance and Class Participation account for twenty five percent",
    "course_pol": "上課時請勿講話、除分組進行討論外，否則應盡量減少邊際對話。\n當同學簡報或提問時，您應該專心地聆聽。當您簡報時，您應該面對自己的小組或全班同學大聲說話，讓同學能聽清楚。\n允許使用筆記型電腦或平板等載具，進行課堂記筆記",
    "course_pol_en": "Clearly state your expectations for teacher-student and student-student interactions both in and out of the classroom.\nDemonstrate respect and consideration for the feelings of other students, unexpected noises and movements that automatically divert and attract attention, such as dress etiquette, classroom food/drinks, sounds (music, speaking, tapping, etc.), exaggerated movements, etc.\nUse laptops and mobile devices in class.\nInternet etiquette rules.\nMediation of classroom and out-of-class time conflicts.\nFields of practice require security specifications.",
    "course_rem": "多樣化、公平和包容性聲明 我的教學設計，要讓來自不同背景和觀點的學生都能從這門課程中獲得很好的學習，學生的學習需求能得到解決，學生帶給這門課的多樣性可以經舉手、邀請您合適地表達出來，並被視為一種資源、力量並惠及所有學生。如有任何疑慮，請利用請益時間來找我。",
    "course_rem_en": "Diversity, Equity and Inclusion Statement I design my instruction so that students from different backgrounds and perspectives can learn well from the course, that the learning needs of the students are addressed, and that the diversity that students bring to the course can be met with a raise of hand, invitation You are appropriately expressed and seen as a resource, strength and benefit to all students. If you have any concerns, please take advantage of the time to come to me.",
    "ais_meno": "<div>學習必須以誠信為基礎，任何學生企圖將自己未製作的作品，作為自己的作品，此行為是為不誠實行為。在作業、測驗或考試中作弊或抄襲的學生或協助他人的行為，該次成績以零分計，若是累犯，將依逢甲大學學生獎懲辦法提送。\n<ul>\n\t<li>考核時如果您抄襲他人的答案、或交作業時您交出全部或部分由他人撰寫的論文或作業，則被視為作弊。</li>\n\t<li>&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n",
    "ais_meno_en": "<div>Design evaluation methods to reduce cheating:\n<ul>\n\t<li>Using authentic assessment (eg, using real data from assignments that can be used for other/practical purposes), multi-stage assessment (individual written then oral), personal reflection, etc., asking questions that require higher order thinking makes cheating more difficult Disaster.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<div>\n<ol>\n\t<li>For each type of graded assignment in the course, explain what is and is not allowed to collaborate or receive outside assistance.</li>\n</ol>\n</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n",
    "ilearn_mk": null
  },
